		{ "Nice choice there, the cluster mod, you can cover a whole area with that.", "Ah, cluster mod, ideal for clearing crowds."},
		{ "Concussion mod. Just makes 'em bombs hurt a lot more.", "Oh yeah, the concussion mod really brings the pain."},
		{ "Bigger drum, classic choice. Now you ain't gotta worry about runnin' out of bombs.", "Good, bigger drum will let you shoot twice as many bombs before havin' to pop it out."},
	},
	{
		{ "Ah, larger drum mod, no more runnin' out of bullets.", "Larger drum means you ain't gotta reload so much."},
		{ "Bigger bore means a bigger bullet.", "This'll let you punch a real hole in the competition."},
		{ "Let's go ahead and get that spread tightened up for ya.", "With this, you'll be able to hit the broad side of a barn for once."},
		{ "Ah, buzzsaw mod. Tears through guys like paper.", "This'll make the Tommy spit hot lead like a fire hose."},
	},
	{
		{ "Faster rockets, makes it easier to hit stuff from afar.", "Yeah, now you'll be able to hit your targets before they can hit you."},
		{ "Standard laser system, lets you track moving targets.", "Ah, laser mod. Now ya don't gotta worry about aiming the thing right away."},
		{ "High explosives for a bigger boom. Just don't stand too close, alright?", "Ey, high explosives, blasts away pretty much anything with real efficiency."},
		{ "The Big Bubba. Makes those regular rockets look like cheap firecrackers, but needs a lot more ammo.", "It's pretty dangerous, but I'll let you have it. Just don't blow up my shop, eh?"},
	},
	{
		{ "Extra range mod, now you ain't gotta worry about burnin' yourself so much.", "With one of these, you can cook 'em nice and crispy from across the room."},
		{ "Ah, hotter flame mod, your enemies will feel the burn way quicker.", "Get yourself a hotter flame mod and light 'em up in a fraction of the time."},
		{ "Adding a fuel pump means you'll get the same burn for less gas.", "Fuel pump, real good investment, saves you a lot of gas."},
		{ "Switch from regular gas to napalm, and you can keep a whole area lit up.", "Ah, napalm mod, that stuff will stick fire to pretty much anything."},
	},
	{
		{ "Stick a scope on there, and you can line up your shots way easier.", "Tactical scope mod, you'll be carryin' a real sniper rifle with that."},
		{ "Oh, the HMG cooling mod, very nice option. Boom boom b-boom boom boom boom! Heheheheh!", "Oh, the HMG cooling mod, that's a nice little number. Turn that baby nearly automatic for ya! Heh." },
		{ "Ah, select fire mod, makes that thing hammer off rounds instead of a burst.", "Select fire, sweet choice. Make that thing into a real automatic, eh?"},
		{ "Anti-material rounds give a nice boom on impact. Ya know they use these to punch through tanks?", "Folks will learn not to mess with you when you show up with these explosive rounds."}
	},
};

